WEBVTT

00:07.965 --> 00:09.206
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.275 --> 00:11.034
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:11.103 --> 00:12.413
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.482 --> 00:14.551
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.620 --> 00:17.551
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.620 --> 00:19.586
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.655 --> 00:21.655
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.724 --> 00:23.241
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.310 --> 00:25.517
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.586 --> 00:27.448
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.517 --> 00:29.517
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.586 --> 00:31.655
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.724 --> 00:33.586
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.655 --> 00:35.689
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.758 --> 00:37.448
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.517 --> 00:39.586
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.655 --> 00:41.068
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:41.137 --> 00:42.862
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.931 --> 00:45.241
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.310 --> 00:47.827
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.896 --> 00:50.689
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:50.931 --> 00:53.827
[silly upbeat music]
[愚蠢欢快的音乐]

00:53.896 --> 01:01.034
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:03.137 --> 01:05.103
[phone ringing]
[电话铃声]

01:05.172 --> 01:07.586
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

01:07.655 --> 01:10.137
Will someone please
answer this phone?
有人请吗
接这个电话吗？

01:10.206 --> 01:12.172
I'm busy.
我很忙。

01:13.310 --> 01:15.482
- I'll get it, Squidward.
- 我会得到它，章鱼哥。

01:15.551 --> 01:17.000
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:17.068 --> 01:18.689
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

01:18.758 --> 01:19.931
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

01:20.000 --> 01:21.517
Oh, almost.
哦，差不多了。

01:21.586 --> 01:22.689
Oh, oh, oh, oh.
哦，哦，哦，哦。

01:22.758 --> 01:24.413
Ah, not that time.
啊，不是那个时候。

01:24.482 --> 01:25.827
Whoa! Whoa!
哇！哇！

01:25.896 --> 01:27.965
- [groans]
- [shouts]
- [呻吟]
- [喊叫]

01:28.034 --> 01:30.241
- Krusty Krab.
- 蟹堡王。

01:30.310 --> 01:33.724
I'm sorry, we don't deliver
to that neighborhood.
抱歉，我们不送货
到那个街区。

01:33.793 --> 01:35.103
- [shouts]
- [喊叫]

01:35.172 --> 01:36.931
Who don't deliver
to what neighborhood?
谁不送货
到哪个街区？

01:37.000 --> 01:38.344
- [unintelligible grumbling]
- [难以理解的抱怨]

01:38.413 --> 01:41.655
We don't deliver to RandomLand!
我们不送货到 RandomLand！

01:41.724 --> 01:43.482
- And why not?
- 为什么不呢？

01:43.551 --> 01:46.413
- Because I heard
the place is crazy
- 因为我听说
这个地方太疯狂了

01:46.482 --> 01:49.241
and no delivery fish
has ever returned.
并且没有送货鱼
曾经回来过。

01:49.310 --> 01:52.517
- Squidward, just because it's
a preposterous neighborhood
- 章鱼哥，只是因为它是
荒唐的街区

01:52.586 --> 01:55.137
where the laws of nature
change randomly
自然法则在那里
随机改变

01:55.206 --> 01:56.931
and the people are all
cuckoo...
人们都是
杜鹃...

01:57.000 --> 01:58.793
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

01:58.862 --> 02:00.896
- Don't mean the Krusty Krab
- 不是指蟹堡王

02:00.965 --> 02:02.310
won't attempt
to take their money.
不会尝试
拿他们的钱。

02:02.379 --> 02:03.724
- [unintelligible grumbling]
- [难以理解的抱怨]

02:03.793 --> 02:06.724
- Mm-hmm.
20 minutes.
- 嗯嗯。
20分钟。

02:06.793 --> 02:10.758
- Well, I'm not cuckoo
enough to go to RandomLand.
- 好吧，我不是杜鹃
足够去RandomLand了。

02:10.827 --> 02:13.413
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

02:15.655 --> 02:18.551
- Someone is cuckoo
enough to go.
- 有人是杜鹃
足够了。

02:19.310 --> 02:21.241
- So what are you two
yentas gabbing about?
- 所以你们两个是什么
元塔斯闲聊？

02:21.310 --> 02:22.827
- Flick.
- [groans]
- 轻弹。
- [呻吟]

02:22.896 --> 02:24.517
- [laughs]
- [笑]

02:25.862 --> 02:27.413
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

02:27.482 --> 02:28.931
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

02:29.000 --> 02:30.103
The delivery will be made,
将进行交货，

02:30.172 --> 02:32.068
and the mission will be
accomplished, sir!
使命将是
完成了，先生！

02:32.137 --> 02:35.172
Um...how do I
get to RandomLand?
嗯...我该怎么办
去随机大陆吗？

02:35.241 --> 02:37.068
- Well,
that's the thing, boy-o.
- 嗯，
就是这样，男孩。

02:37.137 --> 02:38.862
No one really knows.
没有人真正知道。

02:38.931 --> 02:40.793
You just walk around...
你随便走走...

02:40.862 --> 02:43.448
randomly.
随机的。

02:43.517 --> 02:45.172
- Well, that's how
I usually get around.
- 嗯，就是这样
我通常都会四处走动。

02:45.241 --> 02:48.137
[upbeat organ music]
[欢快的管风琴音乐]

02:48.206 --> 02:50.068
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:50.137 --> 02:51.724
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

02:51.793 --> 02:53.620
Ar, ar, ar,
ar, ar, ar!
阿尔，阿尔，阿尔，
啊，啊，啊！

02:53.689 --> 02:55.206
Zoink!
How's that?
佐因克！
怎么样？

02:56.931 --> 02:58.965
[yells]
[喊叫]

02:59.034 --> 03:01.482
- [laughs]
That idiot's getting
- [笑]
那个白痴越来越

03:01.551 --> 03:02.931
lost for sure.
肯定输了。

03:03.000 --> 03:06.034
- You're probably right.
You better go with him.
- 你可能是对的。
你最好和他一起去。

03:06.103 --> 03:07.517
- Well, of course,
that makes sense...
- 嗯，当然，
这是有道理的...

03:07.586 --> 03:10.517
What?
[unintelligible shouting]
什么？
[难以理解的喊叫]

03:10.586 --> 03:13.137
[yelling]
[大喊]

03:13.206 --> 03:15.172
- [laughs]
- [笑]

03:16.586 --> 03:18.413
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

03:22.413 --> 03:24.413
♪ Random walking ♪
♪ 随意行走 ♪

03:25.586 --> 03:27.344
♪ Random walking ♪
♪ 随意行走 ♪

03:27.413 --> 03:29.586
♪ Random walking ♪
♪ 随意行走 ♪

03:31.000 --> 03:33.551
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

03:33.620 --> 03:35.862
Hey, Squidward
I don't think this...
嘿，章鱼哥
我不认为这...

03:35.931 --> 03:39.586
♪ Walking random
thing is working ♪
♪ 随意行走
事情正在运作 ♪

03:41.103 --> 03:42.206
- SpongeBob?
- 海绵宝宝？

03:42.275 --> 03:44.620
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

03:44.689 --> 03:49.103
Oh, no!
SpongeBob has disappeared.
哦，不！
海绵宝宝失踪了。

03:49.172 --> 03:53.172
What ever will I do?
我会做什么？

03:55.137 --> 03:56.448
[laughs]
[笑]

03:56.517 --> 03:58.172
♪ SpongeBob gone
hallelujah ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝走了
哈利路亚♪

03:58.241 --> 04:00.517
♪ SpongeBob gone,
I don't give a tuna ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝走了，
我不给金枪鱼♪

04:03.068 --> 04:05.586
Hummuna-what?
胡姆纳-什么？

04:05.655 --> 04:07.551
[shouting]
[喊叫]

04:09.310 --> 04:10.965
[yelling]
[大喊]

04:11.034 --> 04:12.482
- Beep, beep!
- Of course.
- 嘟嘟嘟！
- 当然。

04:12.551 --> 04:14.482
- Beep, beep!
- [grunts]
- 嘟嘟嘟！
- [咕哝]

04:14.551 --> 04:16.827
- Beep, beep, beep!
- Go around.
- 嘟嘟嘟，嘟嘟嘟！
- 四处走走。

04:19.103 --> 04:22.620
The fun never ends with us,
huh, Squidward?
我们的乐趣永无止境，
哈，章鱼哥？

04:22.689 --> 04:24.862
- [yelling]
- [大喊]

04:24.931 --> 04:27.034
- [laughing]
- [笑]

04:27.103 --> 04:30.000
[goofy frantic music]
[愚蠢疯狂的音乐]

04:30.068 --> 04:37.172
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:46.344 --> 04:48.827
- Good Neptune!
You're hideous.
- 好海王星！
你真丑陋。

04:48.896 --> 04:50.620
- You too.
- 你也是。

04:50.689 --> 04:53.103
But somehow you still
retain your allure.
但不知怎的你还是
保留你的魅力。

04:53.172 --> 04:55.724
[giggles]
- Hm.
[咯咯笑]
- 嗯。

04:57.379 --> 05:00.103
Well, here we are
in RandomLand.
好吧，我们到了
在随机之地。

05:00.172 --> 05:01.689
Sure is for that.
当然是为了这个。

05:02.758 --> 05:04.862
Sure is for that?
[sighs]
确定是为了这个吗？
[叹气]

05:04.931 --> 05:07.310
The neighborhood must
be affecting my speech.
邻里必须
影响我的演讲。

05:07.379 --> 05:10.448
Come on, let's put our
grind to the nose stone.
来吧，让我们把我们的
磨到鼻石。

05:10.517 --> 05:12.413
- Aw, Squidward,
can't we take a minute
- 噢，章鱼哥，
我们不能花一分钟吗

05:12.482 --> 05:14.241
to smell and stop the roses?
闻并阻止玫瑰花？

05:14.310 --> 05:15.862
[laughing]
Smell and stop the roses!
[笑]
闻一闻并停止玫瑰花！

05:15.931 --> 05:19.344
I meant stop and smell the--
[laughing]
我的意思是停下来闻闻——
[笑]

05:20.206 --> 05:21.241
[gasps]
[喘气]

05:21.310 --> 05:23.620
- [unintelligible gibberish]
- [难以理解的胡言乱语]

05:23.689 --> 05:27.448
[creatures beeping
and squeaking]
[生物发出嘟嘟声
和吱吱声]

05:30.758 --> 05:33.206
- Ah. Hm? Ah.
- 啊。嗯？啊。

05:33.275 --> 05:36.827
- [grumbling]
- [抱怨]

05:36.896 --> 05:39.034
Now where are we?
现在我们在哪里？

05:39.103 --> 05:40.586
- There's an exit.
- 有一个出口。

05:41.793 --> 05:44.034
Come on!
快点！

05:44.103 --> 05:45.862
- Huh?
- 啊？

05:45.931 --> 05:47.827
[grunts]
[咕哝]

05:51.379 --> 05:53.206
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

05:53.275 --> 05:54.793
Huh?
[grunts]
啊？
[咕哝]

05:54.862 --> 05:56.965
[screams]
[尖叫声]

06:01.034 --> 06:02.724
- What is it?
- 这是什么？

06:02.793 --> 06:08.413
[doorbells ringing and echoing]
[门铃响起并回响]

06:08.482 --> 06:10.275
Oh, it's those
lost delivery boys!
哦，就是那些
送货小哥丢了！

06:10.344 --> 06:11.482
Let's go and--
我们走吧——

06:11.551 --> 06:13.448
- I'll take that bag.
- 我会拿那个包。

06:13.517 --> 06:15.517
- One delivery's
as good as another.
- 一次送货
和另一个一样好。

06:15.586 --> 06:17.724
- This delivery is property
of the Krusty Krab
- 此交付是财产
蟹堡王的

06:17.793 --> 06:20.034
until it is in the hands
of the person who ordered it!
直到到手为止
订购它的人！

06:20.103 --> 06:23.310
But, ma'am, you can place
an order any time.
但是，女士，你可以把
随时下订单。

06:24.724 --> 06:26.172
- [yelps]
- [尖叫声]

06:26.241 --> 06:27.827
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

06:27.896 --> 06:30.137
- We're sorry, your call
cannot be completed as dialed.
- 很抱歉，您的来电
无法按拨号完成。

06:30.206 --> 06:31.620
- Oh, whoo!
- 哦，哇！

06:31.689 --> 06:35.413
- [groans]
Hand me the address.
- [呻吟]
把地址递给我。

06:37.068 --> 06:39.517
86 Screwball Street.
86 怪诞街。

06:41.068 --> 06:42.551
There's a hole in it.
里面有一个洞。

06:42.620 --> 06:43.931
- Ooh.
- 哦。

06:44.000 --> 06:45.517
I'm a collector.
我是一个收藏家。

06:45.586 --> 06:48.103
- [sighs]
No taste for accounting.
- [叹气]
对会计没有兴趣。

06:48.172 --> 06:51.103
Why don't we just
arbitrarily knock on doors?
我们为什么不直接
随意敲门？

06:51.172 --> 06:52.896
- Hey, now you're
thinking random!
- 嘿，现在你是
思维随意！

06:52.965 --> 06:54.379
Yeah!
There!
是的！
那里！

06:54.448 --> 06:56.551
Screwball Street.
螺旋街。

06:58.034 --> 06:59.655
Knock, knock.
敲，敲。

07:03.000 --> 07:04.793
- Ooh.
[laughs]
- 哦。
[笑]

07:04.862 --> 07:08.482
- Excuse me, ma'am,
did you order a Krabby Patty?
- 对不起，女士，
你点了蟹肉饼吗？

07:08.551 --> 07:13.310
- Can I dunk it in cocoa
like my marshmallows?
- 我可以把它泡在可可里吗
就像我的棉花糖一样？

07:13.379 --> 07:14.931
both: Huh?
两人：啊？

07:15.000 --> 07:17.310
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

07:17.379 --> 07:20.310
- Ooh, may I?
- 哦，可以吗？

07:20.379 --> 07:23.448
[gulping]
[吞咽]

07:26.724 --> 07:28.965
[laughing]
Tough mallows.
[笑]
坚韧的锦葵。

07:29.034 --> 07:30.896
Could be more marshy.
可能会更加沼泽。

07:30.965 --> 07:32.379
[laughing]
[笑]

07:32.448 --> 07:34.344
- Here, brush your tooth.
- 来，刷牙。

07:34.413 --> 07:36.034
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

07:36.103 --> 07:37.931
- [squeaking]
- [吱吱声]

07:39.068 --> 07:41.758
- This whole place
is inside out,
- 这整个地方
是由内而外的，

07:41.827 --> 07:44.068
so why not
an upside-down house?
那么为什么不呢
颠倒的房子？

07:44.137 --> 07:45.655
[doorbell rings]
[门铃响]

07:48.517 --> 07:50.137
- Whoo-hoo!
- 呼呼！

07:50.206 --> 07:52.000
- Oh, hmm.
- 哦，嗯。

07:52.068 --> 07:53.517
For sale.
出售。

07:53.586 --> 07:56.172
- Hello, handsome.
- 你好，帅哥。

07:56.241 --> 07:58.103
- Oh.
[laughs]
- 哦。
[笑]

07:58.172 --> 08:00.931
Well, wouldn't I like you
to get me to like you knowing
嗯，我不会喜欢你吗
让我知道你喜欢我

08:01.000 --> 08:04.689
you would get me
better to know...you?
你会得到我
更好地了解...你？

08:04.758 --> 08:07.103
- Hello, anyone home?
- 你好，有人在家吗？

08:07.172 --> 08:09.275
Maybe I should say
that upside down.
也许我应该说
那个颠倒了。

08:09.344 --> 08:11.551
Ooh, I know!
哦，我知道了！

08:11.620 --> 08:13.793
Hello, anyone home?
你好，有人在家吗？

08:13.862 --> 08:16.310
[gasps]
Ooh, upside-down cake!
[喘气]
哦，颠倒的蛋糕！

08:16.379 --> 08:18.206
Oops.
哎呀。

08:18.275 --> 08:21.103
- I see you've got an eye
for home design, son.
-我看你有眼光
对于家居设计，儿子。

08:21.172 --> 08:25.551
You are gonna love this house.
There's no downside.
你一定会喜欢这所房子的。
没有什么缺点。

08:25.620 --> 08:29.655
You get it,
no downside? Ha, ha!
你明白了，
没有缺点吗？哈，哈！

08:29.724 --> 08:31.482
- Oh, I'm not looking to buy.
I'm just delivering
- 哦，我不想买。
我只是在送货

08:31.551 --> 08:33.310
for the Krabby Krust.
为蟹壳。

08:33.379 --> 08:35.275
- This bag is mine.
- 这个包是我的。

08:35.344 --> 08:36.655
[laughs]
- Oh!
[笑]
- 哦！

08:38.448 --> 08:40.068
[shouting]
[喊叫]

08:42.862 --> 08:45.344
Squidward,
the bag has been snatched!
章鱼哥，
包被抢了！

08:45.413 --> 08:46.827
- Well, that's that.
Let's go home.
- 嗯，就是这样。
我们回家吧。

08:46.896 --> 08:48.517
- No way, Squidward.
That Patty Krabby
- 没门，章鱼哥。
那个帕蒂·克拉比

08:48.586 --> 08:50.137
belongs to the order
who person'd it!
属于订单
谁干的！

08:50.206 --> 08:52.827
Huh?
Come back here!
啊？
回到这里吧！

08:53.965 --> 08:55.413
- I hate my life.
- 我讨厌我的生活。

08:55.482 --> 08:56.517
- [squeaks]
- [吱吱声]

08:56.586 --> 08:57.862
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

08:57.931 --> 08:59.379
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

08:59.448 --> 09:01.448
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

09:01.517 --> 09:03.344
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

09:03.413 --> 09:05.000
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

09:05.068 --> 09:06.482
- [laughs]
- [笑]

09:06.551 --> 09:07.931
[shaver buzzing]
[剃须刀嗡嗡声]

09:08.000 --> 09:09.413
Whoo!
呼！

09:09.482 --> 09:12.137
[laughs]
[笑]

09:12.206 --> 09:13.413
[shaver buzzing]
[剃须刀嗡嗡声]

09:13.482 --> 09:14.724
- Ugh?
- 呃？

09:16.034 --> 09:17.965
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

09:19.793 --> 09:21.758
[panting]
Are you two done?
[气喘吁吁]
你们两个忙完了吗？

09:22.793 --> 09:24.620
both: Not yet!
两人：还没有！

09:30.000 --> 09:31.034
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

09:31.103 --> 09:33.275
Ah, these drumsticks are harder
啊，这些鸡腿更硬

09:33.344 --> 09:34.724
to walk on than high heels.
比高跟鞋还要走路。

09:34.793 --> 09:37.000
- Well, it's all
about balance.
- 好吧，就这样了
关于平衡。

09:38.275 --> 09:40.172
- [laughs]
- [笑]

09:40.241 --> 09:42.068
- [clears throat]
- [清喉咙]

09:42.137 --> 09:45.034
- I order you to return that
delivery to the Krusty Krab!
- 我命令你归还那个
送货到蟹堡王啦！

09:45.103 --> 09:49.586
- Where's your manners?
Haven't you heard of knocking?
- 你的礼貌呢？
你没听说过敲门吗？

09:51.758 --> 09:53.827
- Go ahead, knock.
- 来吧，敲门。

09:55.896 --> 09:57.344
- Just what I wanted,
- 正是我想要的，

09:57.413 --> 10:00.655
a new bag.
[giggling]
一个新包。
[咯咯笑]

10:00.724 --> 10:02.724
- Let's go home.
- 我们回家吧。

10:02.793 --> 10:05.034
- But...what about the patty?
- 但是...肉饼呢？

10:06.448 --> 10:08.517
- Ah!
- 啊！

10:09.275 --> 10:10.344
- [chatters]
- [闲聊]

10:10.413 --> 10:12.586
[door slams]
[关门声]

10:12.655 --> 10:14.034
- [laughs]
- [笑]

10:16.241 --> 10:17.413
[intense music]
[激烈的音乐]

10:17.482 --> 10:19.793
- Oh, this place
is a nightmare!
- 哦，这个地方
是一场噩梦！

10:19.862 --> 10:21.827
No one's ever returned.
[sobbing]
No one's ever returned.
[抽泣]

10:21.896 --> 10:26.517
We're doomed to live
in this insane asylum.
我们注定要活下去
在这个疯人院里。

10:26.586 --> 10:28.241
- Oh, boy!
That means we can stay
- 哦，孩子！
这意味着我们可以留下来

10:28.310 --> 10:29.448
and deliver the patty.
并交付肉饼。

10:29.517 --> 10:31.068
- We made the delivery.
- 我们已经发货了。

10:31.137 --> 10:32.551
Mission accomplished.
任务完成了。

10:32.620 --> 10:34.482
- But--but Mr. Krabs...
- 但是 - 但是蟹老板先生...

10:34.551 --> 10:37.413
- If the foot were on the other
shoe, Krabs would do the same.
- 如果脚在另一只脚上
鞋子，蟹老板也会做同样的事情。

10:37.482 --> 10:39.931
- No, Squidward, Mr. Krabs!
He's right there.
- 不，章鱼哥，蟹老板！
他就在那里。

10:40.000 --> 10:42.586
- [gasps]
He's probably looking for us.
- [喘气]
他可能正在找我们。

10:42.655 --> 10:44.551
Mr. Krabs!
蟹老板！

10:44.620 --> 10:45.965
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

10:46.034 --> 10:47.482
- But we haven't
made our delivery!
- 但我们还没有
交货了！

10:47.551 --> 10:49.206
Mr. Krabs!
Yeow!
蟹老板！
哟！

10:49.275 --> 10:50.896
Ah, ow!
啊，噢！

10:50.965 --> 10:54.034
[upbeat frantic music]
[欢快疯狂的音乐]

10:54.103 --> 11:01.068
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:04.275 --> 11:05.448
both: Huh?
两人：啊？

11:05.517 --> 11:06.793
It's the Krusty Krab!
这是蟹堡王！

11:06.862 --> 11:08.310
[both panting]
[两人都气喘吁吁]

11:08.379 --> 11:10.310
Hey, Mr. Krabs,
thanks for showing us
嘿，蟹老板，
感谢您向我们展示

11:10.379 --> 11:11.724
the way out of RandomLand.
离开随机之地的出路。

11:11.793 --> 11:14.241
- Excuse me, I'm not Krabs.
- 对不起，我不是蟹蟹。

11:14.310 --> 11:16.206
The name is Rodger,
我的名字叫罗杰，

11:16.275 --> 11:19.206
and I walked all the way
from 86 Screwball Street
我一路走来
从 86 螺丝球街

11:19.275 --> 11:22.620
to complainabout never
getting my delivery.
抱怨从不
收到我的送货。

11:22.689 --> 11:25.137
- Oh, your delivery,
my good man.
- 哦，你的送货，
我的好人。

11:25.206 --> 11:26.862
- [gulping]
- [吞咽]

11:26.931 --> 11:29.379
- Mission accomplished.
Better late than never.
- 任务完成。
迟到总比不到好。

11:29.448 --> 11:31.137
- [crying]
- [哭泣]

11:31.206 --> 11:34.413
Better never!
If it's late,
最好永远不要！
如果来晚了的话

11:34.482 --> 11:36.103
it's free.
它是免费的。

11:36.172 --> 11:39.448
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

11:39.517 --> 11:41.965
What?
什么？

什么？